{"ID":"20240306190943-2zyohc4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240306190943-2zyohc4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240306190943-2zyohc4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145741-eaw82x8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145741-c6l711c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145741-c6l711c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"【蜜煎导】\u0026amp;【大猪胆汁方】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312145801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312145741-eaw82x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-eaw82x8","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百四十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-ps5m264","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-ps5m264","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，自汗出，若发汗，小便自利者，此为津液内竭，虽鞕不可攻之，当须自欲大便，宜蜜煎导而通之，若「土瓜根」及「大猪胆汁」皆可为导。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-9tvdv33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-9tvdv33","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"津液亏损的时候，不要急着下手，先等一下，看会不会回头。有的是年老气衰，没有力气排，用土瓜根，大猪胆汁，都是导便的方式。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-mxbo3lx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-mxbo3lx","updated":"20240312145741"}},{"ID":"20240312145741-eqgwjnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-eqgwjnk","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜜煎导法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-pkr8pnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-pkr8pnr","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜜七合，一味，纳铜器中，微火煎之，稍凝似饴状，搅之勿令焦着。欲可丸，并手捻作挺，令头锐，大如指，长二寸许。当热时急作，冷则硬。以纳谷道中，以手急抱，欲大便时乃去之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-iellypi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-iellypi","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种情况是津液内竭，人年老气衰。过去的通大便的方式。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-l4kg5ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-l4kg5ea","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就一味，放锅里面煮缩汁，完毕后后捻成丸，捻成倒锥型，大的一头塞进肛门里使用；"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-n8b58ab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-n8b58ab","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"土瓜根方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-h33mk17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-h33mk17","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"方缺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-bxnmd8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-bxnmd8a","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大猪胆汁方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-g26s0r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-g26s0r1","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大猪胆汁一枚，泻汁，和醋少许，以灌谷道中，如一食顷，当大便出。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145741-r04syy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-r04syy2","updated":"20240312145741"}},{"ID":"20240312145741-c6l711c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145741-c6l711c","updated":"20240312145741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两方制作或获取麻烦，用西药的甘油锭替代使用也是可以的。"}]}]}